abstract: >-
  Long road drives recorded with the inertial, magnetic, barometric and GNSS sensors of
  ordinary smartphones: 29 raw Sensor Logger recordings from seven phone models, 27
  processed 10 Hz trajectories with relief, gravity-anomaly and magnetic-anomaly map tiles,
  and reference baselines from strapdown-rs. This repository holds the memsnav package that
  fetches, rebuilds and packages the data; the data themselves are on Zenodo.
